    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31067" root="عول" body-key="E">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَالَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ظُلَّة</span> [or <i>covering</i>], (K,) or <i>a thing like a</i>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ظُلَّة</span>, (S, O,) <i>used as a shelter from the rain,</i> (S,
O, K,) <i>constructed with cuttings of trees</i> [<i>in a
manner described above:</i> see 2, last sentence].
(TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَعَامَةٌ</span>, (Kr, K,) either as
meaning The <i>species of animal thus called</i> [i. e.
<i>an ostrich</i>], or as meaning <i>a</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ظُلَّة</span>, for thus <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَعَامَةٌ</span>
also signifies. (TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  [As a pl.: see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عِيَالٌ</span>.] ＝ 
 
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A3-  See also art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عيل</span>.

